{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"同伦假设"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"同伦假设"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p>存在 $(\\infty,1)$-范畴的等价\n$$\r\n\\Pi\\colon \\mathsf {Top} \\to \\mathsf{Ani},\r\n$$\n其中 $\\mathsf {Top}$ 是拓扑空间的"},{"Local":{"url":"模型范畴","text":"模型范畴"}},{"Plain":", $\\Pi X$ 为拓扑空间 $X$ "},{"Local":{"url":"数学对象的表现","text":"表现"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":", 也是 $X$ 的奇异单纯集 $\\operatorname{Sing}X$ 表现的生象.</p>\n"}]}}